SUMMARY:An Evening with David Walker — The Fiscal Outlook & Your Federal Retirement
DESCRIPTION:A complimentary educational evening with David M. Walker\, former U.S. Comptroller General\, presented by the Federal Employee Institute. The national fiscal outlook and what it means for your federal benefits — FERS\, TSP\, and the retirement decisions ahead — followed by open Q&A.\n\nDoors open at 5:30 PM. The Hill Aerospace Museum sits outside the base gates — no ID check or base pass required.\n\nMore info: https://www.capitalwealth.com/l/david-walker/
